  "english": "Seek the good they are always kind. They who are destitute of kindly courtesy, even after the lapse of many days, will contemn (those that visit them), saying, ‘they will ask something of us'. The excellent will treat them with distinction whenever they see them, saying, ‘if they ask something of us, it is well'.",
